<%# One production's coming dates (Ticketing::ComingUp::ProductionDates):
    its next date as a show row, and a drawer hanging under it with the few
    dates after that (manage/ticketing/more_dates). Locals: row. %>
<div>
  <%= render "manage/ticketing/coming_up_row", listing: row.next_listing, stats: row.next_stats %>
  <%= render "manage/ticketing/more_dates", row: row %>
</div>
